PROJECT NOTICE / 项目声明

This notice explains the intended use of the project and does not add any
condition to the MIT License above.

FinOS AI is open-source infrastructure for enterprise information analysis,
financial research, risk identification, and workflow assistance. It does not
provide investment, credit, lending, legal, audit, accounting, or compliance
advice, and it must not be treated as an autonomous approval or trading system.

Anyone deploying or operating the Software is responsible for data rights,
access control, model-provider selection, human review, regulatory compliance,
and decisions made with information produced by the Software. AI-generated
content may be incomplete, outdated, or incorrect and must be independently
verified before use in any material decision.

本声明用于解释项目用途，不对上述 MIT 许可证增加任何额外条件。

FinOS AI 是面向企业资料理解、金融研究、风险识别与流程辅助的开源基础设施，
不提供投资、授信、借贷、法律、审计、会计或合规意见，也不应被视为自动审批、
自动交易或无人值守决策系统。

软件的部署者和运营者应自行负责数据授权、访问控制、模型供应商选择、人工复核、
监管合规以及基于软件输出作出的决定。AI 生成内容可能不完整、过时或错误，任何
重大决策均应由具备相应职责和资质的人员独立核验。
